AU  - Ahmadian, Ali
KW  - Wireless Sensor Networks
KW  - trust
KW  - energy-aware routing
KW  - adversarial
KW  - security
AB  - ETERS is a comprehensive trust-based and energy-aware routing scheme for adversarial WSNs integrating communication/data/energy trust with enhanced cluster head selection (ECHSA), Beta-based trust updates with irregular attenuation, and a trust-based attack detection algorithm (TADA). Evaluations against QEBSR/ATRP/ELPC/SQEER show improvements in energy, latency, throughput, and PDR under normal and attack scenarios.
